      One tab for the people, holding «Ученики» and «Группы» as two views of the same set. A group
      *is* students seen as a roster, so the two never needed separate tabs — and the old arrangement
      cost a settings switch, a conditional entry in «Ещё» and a fifth tab the labels were already
      auto-shrinking to fit.
    -->
